# NOTHING in this folder is committed. Every file here is a vendor document -- the
# Pt V2, Ft+ and Hd schematics and STEP models from Alchitry, and Espressif's
# ESP32-C3-MINI datasheet -- and all of them are downloadable from the URLs listed
# in ../README.md section 7.
#
# They total ~135 MB, against a repository whose .git is 96 MB and whose largest
# tracked file is 10 MB; FtPlus.step alone is 65 MB, past GitHub's 50 MB warning.
# Committing them would more than double the repo, permanently, to store documents
# we did not author and can fetch again in a minute.
#
# Every number in ../README.md is sourced to a named sheet, page or table of these
# documents, so the analysis survives without the files being here.
*
!.gitignore
